Reports a failed MBTiles request instead of terminating the process when the
file is not a readable MBTiles database or its metadata does not parse. Treats
an empty mbtiles:// path as not absolute instead of throwing
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1435).
Upstream: https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/pull/4921

